# Procurement Policy

**Document Type:** Corporate Policy
**Authority Level:** 1 (Authoritative)
**Policy Number:** POL-004
**Effective Date:** January 1, 2025
**Last Reviewed:** January 2026
**Owner:** Chief Procurement Officer
**Classification:** Internal

---

## Purpose

This policy establishes standards for the procurement of goods and services at Nexus Industries, ensuring fair competition, value optimization, compliance, and supplier diversity.

---

## Scope

This policy applies to:
- All purchases of goods and services
- All employees with purchasing authority
- All divisions and locations
- All contract types (fixed, time & materials, cost-plus)

**Exclusions:**
- Real estate transactions (separate policy)
- M&A (separate policy)
- Employee compensation/benefits

---

## Procurement Principles

| Principle | Description |
|-----------|-------------|
| **Value** | Total cost of ownership, not just price |
| **Competition** | Fair and open competition |
| **Transparency** | Documented decisions |
| **Integrity** | Ethical dealings, no conflicts |
| **Compliance** | Legal and regulatory adherence |
| **Sustainability** | Environmental and social responsibility |

---

## Spending Authority

### Approval Thresholds

| Amount | Approval Required |
|--------|-------------------|
| <$10,000 | Budget holder |
| $10,000-$50,000 | Manager + Procurement |
| $50,000-$250,000 | Director + Procurement |
| $250,000-$1,000,000 | VP + CPO |
| $1,000,000-$5,000,000 | Division President + CFO |
| >$5,000,000 | CEO |
| >$25,000,000 | Board approval |

### Delegation

- Authority cannot exceed delegator's limit
- Must be in writing
- Subject to audit

---

## Sourcing Requirements

### Competitive Bidding

| Purchase Value | Requirement |
|----------------|-------------|
| <$10,000 | One quote |
| $10,000-$50,000 | Two quotes |
| $50,000-$250,000 | Three quotes (RFQ) |
| >$250,000 | Formal RFP |
| >$1,000,000 | Formal RFP + negotiation |

### Exceptions to Competition

| Exception | Approval Required |
|-----------|-------------------|
| Sole source (technical) | VP + CPO |
| Emergency | VP (with ratification) |
| Standardization | CPO |
| Customer mandate | Division President |

