## Supplier Selection

### Evaluation Criteria

| Criterion | Typical Weight |
|-----------|----------------|
| Price/Cost | 30-40% |
| Quality | 20-30% |
| Delivery/Capability | 15-25% |
| Technical Fit | 10-20% |
| Financial Stability | 5-10% |
| Sustainability | 5-10% |

### Required Assessments

| Spend Level | Assessment Required |
|-------------|---------------------|
| >$100,000 | Financial review |
| >$250,000 | Quality audit |
| >$500,000 | On-site assessment |
| >$1,000,000 | Executive approval + full due diligence |

---

## Contract Management

### Contract Requirements

| Contract Value | Requirements |
|----------------|--------------|
| <$50,000 | Standard PO terms |
| $50,000-$250,000 | Standard contract template |
| $250,000-$1,000,000 | Legal review |
| >$1,000,000 | Legal + Finance review |

### Standard Terms

| Clause | Requirement |
|--------|-------------|
| Payment Terms | Net 45 standard |
| Warranty | Minimum 1 year |
| Indemnification | Required |
| Insurance | Per risk assessment |
| Termination | For convenience + cause |
| Confidentiality | Required |
| IP Rights | Clear ownership |
| Audit Rights | Required (>$100K) |

