## Supplier Diversity

### Goals

| Category | FY2026 Target |
|----------|---------------|
| Small Business | 23% of eligible |
| Small Disadvantaged | 8% |
| Women-Owned | 5% |
| Veteran-Owned | 3% |
| HUBZone | 3% |
| Minority-Owned | 10% |

### Requirements

- Include diverse suppliers in RFPs when possible
- Document outreach efforts
- Report quarterly on performance
- Mentor relationships with diverse suppliers

