## Ethical Standards

### Prohibited Practices

- Kickbacks or bribes
- Undisclosed conflicts of interest
- Sharing bid information
- Bid rigging or collusion
- Accepting gifts beyond policy limits
- Circumventing approval limits

### Conflict of Interest

| Situation | Action Required |
|-----------|-----------------|
| Personal relationship with supplier | Disclosure, recusal |
| Financial interest in supplier | Disclosure, recusal |
| Former employer | Disclosure, potential recusal |
| Gift/entertainment above limits | Decline or return |

---

## Purchase Methods

### Approved Methods

| Method | Use Case | Limit |
|--------|----------|-------|
| Corporate Card | Low-value, approved vendors | $5,000/transaction |
| Purchase Order | Standard procurement | Per authority |
| Contract | Services, complex purchases | Per authority |
| Blanket PO | Recurring purchases | Annual limit |
| Catalog Order | Pre-negotiated items | Per catalog |

### Prohibited

- Personal credit cards (for company purchases)
- Verbal agreements >$5,000
- Supplier financing without CFO approval
- Prepayment >30% without approval

