## Supplier Performance

### Monitoring

| Supplier Category | Review Frequency |
|-------------------|------------------|
| Strategic | Quarterly |
| Preferred | Semi-annual |
| Approved | Annual |
| New | After first delivery |

### Performance Metrics

| Metric | Target |
|--------|--------|
| On-Time Delivery | >95% |
| Quality (PPM) | <500 |
| Responsiveness | <24 hour response |
| Cost Variance | <5% of quote |

